<p id="A1.SS3.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\mapsto 1/(1+x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">↦</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\mapsto 1/(1+x)</annotation></semantics></math> is decreasing on <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{R}_{+}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{R}_{+}</annotation></semantics></math>, it follows that</span></p>
