<p id="A1.SS3.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">proving <a href="#A1.E8" title="In Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>. Finally, taking <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=t</annotation></semantics></math> and evaluating <a href="#A1.E8" title="In Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>
at <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t+d_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t+d_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> gives</span></p>
