<div id="A1.SS3.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">It is easily seen that <a href="#A1.Ex35" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equations</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IH1</span></a> and <a href="#A1.Ex36" title="Equation IH2 ‣ Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IH2</span></a> hold at initialization since <math id="A1.SS3.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{1}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{1}=1</annotation></semantics></math>
and <math id="A1.SS3.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{1}^{h}=\rho^{h}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{1}^{h}=\rho^{h}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, and the fact that since <math id="A1.SS3.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{1}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{1}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> we have <math id="A1.SS3.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{1}^{h}=F_{1}^{h}/C_{1}=\rho^{h}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{1}^{h}=F_{1}^{h}/C_{1}=\rho^{h}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Now assume by strong induction that <a href="#A1.Ex35" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IH1</span></a>
holds for all <math id="A1.SS3.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\leq t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\leq t</annotation></semantics></math> and that <a href="#A1.Ex36" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IH2</span></a> holds for all <math id="A1.SS3.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s&lt;t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s&lt;t</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">We first show that the hypotheses imply that <a href="#A1.Ex36" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IH2</span></a> holds on round <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>.
Fix <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Since <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}\subseteq\mathcal{H}_{{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}\subseteq\mathcal{H}_{{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that
if <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> then <a href="#A1.Ex35" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IH1</span></a> gives</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\Pi_{t}F_{t})^{h}=F_{t}^{h}&gt;0." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\Pi_{t}F_{t})^{h}=F_{t}^{h}&gt;0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p8.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p8.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\tau,t}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\tau,t}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{\tau}^{h}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{\tau}^{h}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math> for every <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in m_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in m_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>,
we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle P_{t}^{h}\coloneq(\Pi_{t}F_{t})^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}(\Pi_{t}w_{\tau})^{h}&gt;0." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≔</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>h</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle P_{t}^{h}\coloneq(\Pi_{t}F_{t})^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}(\Pi_{t}w_{\tau})^{h}&gt;0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p8.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p8.3.1" class="ltx_text">Otherwise, if <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, then we have
from <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0&lt;C_{t}=S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}=\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0&lt;C_{t}=S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}=\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p8.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p8.4.1" class="ltx_text">so some <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\tau,t}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\tau,t}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>. For this <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>,
since <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}\subseteq\mathcal{H}_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}\subseteq\mathcal{H}_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math>, the vector
<math id="A1.SS3.p8.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math> was positive at index <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math>
on round <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> as well (via the inductive
hypothesis), so
we again have that <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{t}^{h}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{t}^{h}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Thus, in either case we have
<math id="A1.SS3.p8.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{t}^{h}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{t}^{h}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> whenever <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Now since <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{t}^{h}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{t}^{h}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, and since <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>
ensures that <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle w_{t}^{h}=\frac{P_{t}^{h}}{C_{t}}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle w_{t}^{h}=\frac{P_{t}^{h}}{C_{t}}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p8.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p8.5.1" class="ltx_text">whenever <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Likewise,
we have <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{t}^{h}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{t}^{h}=0</annotation></semantics></math> whenever <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\notin\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∉</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\notin\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>
by definition of <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{t}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{t}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, and hence also
<math id="A1.SS3.p8.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}^{h}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}^{h}=0</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\notin\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∉</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\notin\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore, we have shown that <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}\in\mathbb{R}^{|\mathcal{H}|}_{\geq 0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}\in\mathbb{R}^{|\mathcal{H}|}_{\geq 0}</annotation></semantics></math>
and</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{supp}(w_{t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{supp}(w_{t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p8.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p8.6.1" class="ltx_text">Moreover, since <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is non-empty,
we have that <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}^{h}=\eta_{h}w_{t}^{h}/\sum_{k}\eta_{k}w_{t}^{k}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">/</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}^{h}=\eta_{h}w_{t}^{h}/\sum_{k}\eta_{k}w_{t}^{k}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>
and <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{h}q_{t}^{h}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>h</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{h}q_{t}^{h}=1</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> defines a valid
probability distribution on <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">It remains to prove <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{{t+1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{{t+1}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Recall that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle F_{{t+1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle F_{{t+1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex42.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle S_{{t+1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle S_{{t+1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex43.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">and observe that by <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> we have
<math id="A1.SS3.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}-a_{t,t}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}-a_{t,t}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, while <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{\tau,t}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{\tau,t}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> clearly holds by <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.
Hence, if <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{{t+1}}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{{t+1}}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, we must have <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{t}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{t}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}-a_{t,t}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}-a_{t,t}=0</annotation></semantics></math>,
in which case <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{{t+1}}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{{t+1}}=0</annotation></semantics></math> as well.
Otherwise, if <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{{t+1}}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{{t+1}}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, then either <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}-a_{t,t}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}-a_{t,t}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A1.SS3.p9.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{t}\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{t}\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>, or both, so at least one vector
in <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math>
occurs with a positive coefficient.
Thus, since we know <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{supp}(w_{t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{supp}(w_{t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>,
if we can show that <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{supp}(u_{\tau,t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{supp}(u_{\tau,t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>
we will have that <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{supp}(F_{t+1})=\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{supp}(F_{t+1})=\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> as well, concluding the induction.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">To this end, observe that for for <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle u_{\tau,t}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle u_{\tau,t}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex44.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=w_{\tau}^{h}\left(1+\frac{\eta_{h}}{a_{\tau,t}}r_{\tau}^{h}\right)\geq w_{\tau}^{h}\left(1-\frac{\eta_{h}}{2a_{\tau,t}}\right)\geq\frac{1}{2}w_{\tau}^{h}&gt;0," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=w_{\tau}^{h}\left(1+\frac{\eta_{h}}{a_{\tau,t}}r_{\tau}^{h}\right)\geq w_{\tau}^{h}\left(1-\frac{\eta_{h}}{2a_{\tau,t}}\right)\geq\frac{1}{2}w_{\tau}^{h}&gt;0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">where we’ve used the fact that <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{h}/a_{\tau,t}\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{h}/a_{\tau,t}\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>
and the fact that <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{\tau}^{h}\geq-\frac{1}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{\tau}^{h}\geq-\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore, <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{supp}(u_{\tau,t})\subseteq\mathrm{supp}(w_{\tau})=\mathcal{H}_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>⊆</mo><mrow><mi>supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{supp}(u_{\tau,t})\subseteq\mathrm{supp}(w_{\tau})=\mathcal{H}_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math> via <a href="#A1.Ex36" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IH2</span></a>.
Moreover, since <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}\subseteq\mathcal{H}_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}\subseteq\mathcal{H}_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math>, and since we have by definition that <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{\tau,t}^{h}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{\tau,t}^{h}=0</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\notin\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∉</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\notin\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>,
and we in fact have that <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{supp}(u_{\tau,t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>supp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{supp}(u_{\tau,t})=\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p11.1" class="ltx_p">The following result derives a delayed variant of the usual ML-Prod
telescoping identity. It relies on a non-trivial
auxiliary lemma, <a href="#Thmlemma5" title="Lemma 5. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, showing that
<math id="A1.SS3.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{h}F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>h</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{h}F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math>, proven at the end of the section.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 4</span></span><span id="Thmlemma4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For every <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="Thmlemma4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{h}\leq 1/\sigma_{\max}^{+}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{h}\leq 1/\sigma_{\max}^{+}</annotation></semantics></math>, it holds that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{\tau=1}^{T}a_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}\log\frac{u_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}\leq\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{\tau=1}^{T}a_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}\log\frac{u_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}\leq\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS3.p12" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text">Fix any <math id="A1.SS3.p12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> satisfying <math id="A1.SS3.p12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{h}\leq\frac{1}{\sigma_{\max}^{+}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{h}\leq\frac{1}{\sigma_{\max}^{+}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then
<math id="A1.SS3.p12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{h}(1+\left|m_{t}\right|)\leq\eta_{h}\sigma_{\max}^{+}\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{h}(1+\left|m_{t}\right|)\leq\eta_{h}\sigma_{\max}^{+}\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math> on every round,
so algorithm <math id="A1.SS3.p12.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math> is never retired.
In particular, its coordinate is never masked out by <math id="A1.SS3.p12.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pi_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pi_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Define the potential function</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx28" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Phi_{t}^{h}\coloneq S_{t}\log\frac{F_{t}^{h}}{S_{t}}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,{t-1}}\log w_{\tau}^{h}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Phi_{t}^{h}\coloneq S_{t}\log\frac{F_{t}^{h}}{S_{t}}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,{t-1}}\log w_{\tau}^{h},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p12.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p12.2.1" class="ltx_text">where we use the convention that <math id="A1.SS3.p12.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\log(x)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\log(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math> when <math id="A1.SS3.p12.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=0</annotation></semantics></math>
(Note that <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> ensures that
every logarithm has a positive argument whenever
its coefficient is non-zero).</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p13" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p13.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p13.1.1" class="ltx_text">Now for <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx29" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle w_{t}^{h}=\frac{F_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}w_{\tau}^{h}}{S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle w_{t}^{h}=\frac{F_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}w_{\tau}^{h}}{S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p13.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p13.2.1" class="ltx_text">If <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, this is a convex combination of <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{t}^{h}/S_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{t}^{h}/S_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and the
<math id="A1.SS3.p13.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{\tau}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{\tau}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in m_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in m_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx30" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{S_{t}\left(F_{t}^{h}/S_{t}\right)+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}w_{\tau}^{h}}{S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{S_{t}\left(F_{t}^{h}/S_{t}\right)+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}w_{\tau}^{h}}{S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p13.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p13.3.1" class="ltx_text">Hence by concavity of the <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\mapsto\log x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">↦</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\mapsto\log x</annotation></semantics></math> and Jensen’s inequality
we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx31" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex49"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle C_{t}\log w_{t}^{h}\geq S_{t}\log\frac{F_{t}^{h}}{S_{t}}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}\log(w_{\tau}^{h})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle C_{t}\log w_{t}^{h}\geq S_{t}\log\frac{F_{t}^{h}}{S_{t}}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}\log(w_{\tau}^{h}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p13.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p13.4.1" class="ltx_text">adding <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math> to both sides and using
<math id="A1.SS3.p13.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\tau,t}+a_{\tau,t}=a_{\tau,{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\tau,t}+a_{\tau,t}=a_{\tau,{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math> yields</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle C_{t}\log w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle C_{t}\log w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq S_{t}\log\frac{F_{t}^{h}}{S_{t}}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,{t-1}}\log w_{\tau}^{h}=\Phi_{t}^{h}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq S_{t}\log\frac{F_{t}^{h}}{S_{t}}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,{t-1}}\log w_{\tau}^{h}=\Phi_{t}^{h}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p14" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text">An analogous argument holds for the case <math id="A1.SS3.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}=0</annotation></semantics></math> by omitting
the terms with <math id="A1.SS3.p14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p15" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p15.1.1" class="ltx_text">Moreover, by definition of
<math id="A1.SS3.p15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math>
and
<math id="A1.SS3.p15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have that
<math id="A1.SS3.p15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{{t+1}}/S_{{t+1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{{t+1}}/S_{{t+1}}</annotation></semantics></math> defines a convex combination of <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and the
<math id="A1.SS3.p15.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math>, hence,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle S_{{t+1}}\log\frac{F_{{t+1}}^{h}}{S_{{t+1}}}\geq(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\log w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log u_{\tau,t}^{h}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle S_{{t+1}}\log\frac{F_{{t+1}}^{h}}{S_{{t+1}}}\geq(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\log w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log u_{\tau,t}^{h}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p15.2.1" class="ltx_text">Note this holds when <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{{t+1}}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{{t+1}}=0</annotation></semantics></math> as well since in this case all
coefficients on the RHS are zero.
Now using the fact that <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{{t+1}}=(m_{t}\cup\left\{t\right\})\setminus\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{{t+1}}=(m_{t}\cup\left\{t\right\})\setminus\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> (via <a href="#Thmlemma13" title="Lemma 13. ‣ Appendix D Supporting Lemmas ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>), we have
that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx34" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{\tau\in m_{{t+1}}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}=\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}+a_{t,t}\log w_{t}^{h}-\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{\tau\in m_{{t+1}}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}=\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}+a_{t,t}\log w_{t}^{h}-\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p15.3.1" class="ltx_text">so adding <a href="#A1.E11" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> to <a href="#A1.E12" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, yields</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx35" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex50"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex50.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Phi_{{t+1}}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Phi_{{t+1}}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex50.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq C_{t}\log w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq C_{t}\log w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log w_{\tau}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex51"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq\Phi_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq\Phi_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p15.4.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality uses <a href="#A1.E10" title="In Proof. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.
Now summing over <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> and noting that
each feedback item appears only once yields</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx36" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex52.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{\tau=1}^{T}a_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}\log\frac{u_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}\leq\sum_{t=1}^{T}\left(\Phi_{{t+1}}^{h}-\Phi_{t}^{h}\right)=\Phi_{T+1}^{h}-\Phi_{1}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{\tau=1}^{T}a_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}\log\frac{u_{\tau,\tau+d_{\tau}}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}\leq\sum_{t=1}^{T}\left(\Phi_{{t+1}}^{h}-\Phi_{t}^{h}\right)=\Phi_{T+1}^{h}-\Phi_{1}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\Phi_{T+1}^{h}+\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\Phi_{T+1}^{h}+\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p15.5.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, since <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{T+1}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{T+1}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>, <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>
yields <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{T+1}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{T+1}=1</annotation></semantics></math>, and since <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> is still active,
<a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> gives <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{T+1}^{h}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{T+1}^{h}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> while
<a href="#Thmlemma5" title="Lemma 5. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> gives <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math>.
Taken together, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx37" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Phi_{T+1}^{h}=\log F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 0." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Phi_{T+1}^{h}=\log F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p15.6.1" class="ltx_text">Hence,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx38" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\frac{u_{\tau,t}^{h}}{w_{\tau}^{h}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex55.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\Phi_{T+1}^{h}+\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}\leq\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}.\qed" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">.</mo><mo class="ltx_mathvariant_italic" lspace="0.0835em" mathvariant="italic" separator="true">∎</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\Phi_{T+1}^{h}+\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}\leq\log\frac{1}{\rho^{h}}.\qed</annotation></semantics></math></td>
