<div id="A1.SS3.p16" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p16.1" class="ltx_p">The following lemma provides a crucial but annoying result
showing that we have <math id="A1.SS3.p16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math> above, despite
some of the experts starting out with a
meta-learning rate <math id="A1.SS3.p16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{h}&gt;\frac{1}{\sigma_{\max}^{+}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{h}&gt;\frac{1}{\sigma_{\max}^{+}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 5</span></span><span id="Thmlemma5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">It holds that
<math id="Thmlemma5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{T+1}^{h}\leq 1.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.5" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS3.p17" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p17.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p17.1.1" class="ltx_text">We prove the result via potential argument.
Before the retirement at round <math id="A1.SS3.p17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, define</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx39" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle M_{t}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,{t-1}}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{{t-1}}}w_{\tau}^{h}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle M_{t}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,{t-1}}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{{t-1}}}w_{\tau}^{h}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p17.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p17.2.1" class="ltx_text">Observe that <math id="A1.SS3.p17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{1}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{1}^{h}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}\rho^{h}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mi>h</mi></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{1}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{1}^{h}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}\rho^{h}=1</annotation></semantics></math>,
and since <math id="A1.SS3.p17.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{T+1}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{T+1}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> we have <math id="A1.SS3.p17.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{T+1}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{T+1}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{T+1}=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{T+1}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx40" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex57"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex57.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{T+1}^{h}=M_{T+1}=M_{1}+\sum_{t=1}^{T}\left(M_{{t+1}}-M_{t}\right)=1+\sum_{t=1}^{T}\left(M_{{t+1}}-M_{t}\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{T+1}^{h}=M_{T+1}=M_{1}+\sum_{t=1}^{T}\left(M_{{t+1}}-M_{t}\right)=1+\sum_{t=1}^{T}\left(M_{{t+1}}-M_{t}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p17.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p17.3.1" class="ltx_text">so we proceed by bounding the increments <math id="A1.SS3.p17.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{{t+1}}-M_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{{t+1}}-M_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p18" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p18.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p18.1.1" class="ltx_text">We have by definition that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx41" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex58"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle M_{{t+1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle M_{{t+1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex58.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{{t+1}}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{{t+1}}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}F_{{t+1}}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{{t+1}}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody><tr class="ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline"><td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_left" style="white-space:normal;" colspan="5">Substituting the definition of
<math id="A1.EGx41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{{t,t}})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{{t+1}}=(C_{t}-a_{{t,t}})w_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}u_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math>:</td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex59.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{{t,t}})\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}u_{\tau,t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{{t+1}}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{{t,t}})\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}}u_{\tau,t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{{t+1}}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody><tr class="ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline"><td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_left" style="white-space:normal;" colspan="5">and recalling that <math id="A1.EGx41.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{t}\cup\left\{t\right\}=m_{{t+1}}\cup\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{t}\cup\left\{t\right\}=m_{{t+1}}\cup\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>,
where <math id="A1.EGx41.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{{t+1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{{t+1}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.EGx41.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> are disjoint (<a href="#Thmlemma13" title="Lemma 13. ‣ Appendix D Supporting Lemmas ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>), and
that <math id="A1.EGx41.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.EGx41.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math> are zero outside <math id="A1.EGx41.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>
(<a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>):</td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex60"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex60.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{{t,t}})\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}\left[u_{\tau,t}^{h}-w_{\tau}^{h}\right]+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}\cup\left\{t\right\}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(C_{t}-a_{{t,t}})\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}\left[u_{\tau,t}^{h}-w_{\tau}^{h}\right]+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}\cup\left\{t\right\}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex61"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex61.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=C_{t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}\frac{\eta_{h}}{a_{\tau,t}}r_{\tau}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=C_{t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{t}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}\frac{\eta_{h}}{a_{\tau,t}}r_{\tau}^{h}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\sum_{h\in\mathcal{H}_{t}}w_{\tau}^{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex62"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
