<p id="A1.SS3.p18.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p18.12.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(a)</annotation></semantics></math> uses the fact that <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{t}=\left\{\tau:t=\tau+d_{\tau}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{t}=\left\{\tau:t=\tau+d_{\tau}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math>
and <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{s}=\left\{\tau&lt;s:s\leq\tau+d_{\tau}\right\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{s}=\left\{\tau&lt;s:s\leq\tau+d_{\tau}\right\}</annotation></semantics></math> to re-index
the summations as
<math id="A1.SS3.p18.m15" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}\sum_{s=\tau+1}^{t}=\sum_{\tau=1}^{T}\sum_{s=\tau+1}^{\tau+d_{\tau}}=\sum_{s=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in m_{s}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.111em" rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.111em" rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}\sum_{s=\tau+1}^{t}=\sum_{\tau=1}^{T}\sum_{s=\tau+1}^{\tau+d_{\tau}}=\sum_{s=1}^{T}\sum_{\tau\in m_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math>,
while <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(b)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(b)</annotation></semantics></math> uses <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|r_{\tau}^{h}\right|\leq\frac{1}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|r_{\tau}^{h}\right|\leq\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math> and the fact that,
for <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h\in D_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h\in D_{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, expert <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> survives through round <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s-1</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{h}\leq\frac{1}{1+\max_{r&lt;s}\left|m_{r}\right|}\leq a_{\tau,s-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{h}\leq\frac{1}{1+\max_{r&lt;s}\left|m_{r}\right|}\leq a_{\tau,s-1}</annotation></semantics></math>
for every <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in m_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in m_{s}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p19" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p19.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p19.1.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, we have that the RHS is non-positive since
<math id="A1.SS3.p19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{t}^{h}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{t}^{h}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS3.p19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{\tau}^{h}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{\tau}^{h}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS3.p19.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{\tau,{t-1}}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{\tau,{t-1}}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>
by <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemmas</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.
Hence,</span></p>
