<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">See <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4.2 Universal Regret Guarantee ‣ 4 Universal Regret with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a></p>
