</table>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Denote <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z_{t}^{h}=\left\langle g_{t},x_{t}-x_{t}^{h}\right\rangle=2GDr_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z_{t}^{h}=\left\langle g_{t},x_{t}-x_{t}^{h}\right\rangle=2GDr_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Applying <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem2" title="Corollary 3.2. ‣ Algorithm design. ‣ 3 Second-order Expert Aggregation with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Corollary</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a>, we obtain</p>
