<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(a)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(a)</annotation></semantics></math> follows from <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1. ‣ Desired guarantee. ‣ 3 Second-order Expert Aggregation with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and
<math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(z_{t}^{h})^{2}=\left\langle g_{t},x_{t}-x_{t}^{h}\right\rangle^{2}\leq G^{2}\|x_{t}-x_{t}^{h}\|_{2}^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(z_{t}^{h})^{2}=\left\langle g_{t},x_{t}-x_{t}^{h}\right\rangle^{2}\leq G^{2}\|x_{t}-x_{t}^{h}\|_{2}^{2},</annotation></semantics></math>
which together imply</p>
