<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Omitted Details from Section <a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Improved Regret Bound for Exp-concave Losses ‣ 4 Universal Regret with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a></h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For completeness, we restate <a href="#A3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>, which shows the main regret bound of <a href="#algorithm2" title="In 4.1 Improved Regret Bound for Exp-concave Losses ‣ 4 Universal Regret with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, and
provide its proof. We first introduce some notation that will be used throughout the proof. For every round <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[T]</annotation></semantics></math>, define</p>
<table id="A3.E24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{t}(x)\coloneq\langle g_{t},x\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{t}(x)\coloneq\langle g_{t},x\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
