<div id="A3.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem C.1</span></span><span id="A3.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1 (Bounded domain and gradients). ‣ 2 Problem Setting ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Assumptions</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and <a href="#Thmassumption3" title="Assumption 3 (𝛼-exp-concavity). ‣ 2 Problem Setting ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> hold. Then
<a href="#algorithm2" title="In 4.1 Improved Regret Bound for Exp-concave Losses ‣ 4 Universal Regret with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> guarantees that, for every
<math id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u\in\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u\in\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math> and every <math id="A3.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in\{0,\ldots,T\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in\{0,\ldots,T\}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx60" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\operatorname{Reg}_{T}(u)\leq\frac{\eta_{T}D^{2}}{2}+\frac{n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{T}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}T}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+\frac{\sigma_{\tau}n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{\tau}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}\tau}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+G^{2}\sum_{t=\tau+1}^{T}\frac{|m_{t}|}{\eta_{t}}\;." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Reg</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\operatorname{Reg}_{T}(u)\leq\frac{\eta_{T}D^{2}}{2}+\frac{n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{T}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}T}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+\frac{\sigma_{\tau}n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{\tau}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}\tau}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+G^{2}\sum_{t=\tau+1}^{T}\frac{|m_{t}|}{\eta_{t}}\;.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Recall from <a href="#A3.E24" title="In Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equations</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E25" title="Equation 25 ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a> that, for every round <math id="A3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[T]</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex111" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex111.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{t}(x)=\langle g_{t},x\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2}\text{~~and~~}\overline{H}_{t}(x)=H_{t}(x)+\frac{\eta_{t+d_{t}}-\eta_{t-1}}{2}\lVert x-x_{t}\rVert_{2}^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> and </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{t}(x)=\langle g_{t},x\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2}\text{~~and~~}\overline{H}_{t}(x)=H_{t}(x)+\frac{\eta_{t+d_{t}}-\eta_{t-1}}{2}\lVert x-x_{t}\rVert_{2}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">For brevity, let
<math id="A3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{t}\coloneq a_{t,t+d_{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≔</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{t}\coloneq a_{t,t+d_{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math>
Since <math id="A3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> minimizes <math id="A3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and the additional regularizer is
centered at <math id="A3.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have
<math id="A3.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{H}_{t}(x_{t})=\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}\overline{H}_{t}(x)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{H}_{t}(x_{t})=\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}\overline{H}_{t}(x).</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Using <a href="#Thmassumption3" title="Assumption 3 (𝛼-exp-concavity). ‣ 2 Problem Setting ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Assumption</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#Thmlemma10" title="Lemma 10 ( , , Lemma 3). ‣ Appendix D Supporting Lemmas ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx61" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex112"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex112.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f_{t}(x_{t})-f_{t}(u)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f_{t}(x_{t})-f_{t}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex112.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\ell_{t}(x_{t})-\ell_{t}(u)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\ell_{t}(x_{t})-\ell_{t}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex113"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex113.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\ell_{t}(x_{t})+a_{t}\overline{H}_{t}(u)-a_{t}\overline{H}_{t}(u)-\ell_{t}(u)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\ell_{t}(x_{t})+a_{t}\overline{H}_{t}(u)-a_{t}\overline{H}_{t}(u)-\ell_{t}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex114"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
