<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">We distinguish two cases. Suppose first that</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex123" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex123.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\sigma_{\max}n}{2\beta D^{2}}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right)\leq\frac{G}{D}\sqrt{1+d_{\mathrm{tot}}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>tot</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\sigma_{\max}n}{2\beta D^{2}}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right)\leq\frac{G}{D}\sqrt{1+d_{\mathrm{tot}}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">Then the first branch in the definition of <math id="A3.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, so
<math id="A3.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{T}=\eta_{0}+\frac{\sigma_{\max}n}{2\beta D^{2}}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{T}=\eta_{0}+\frac{\sigma_{\max}n}{2\beta D^{2}}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>.
Applying <a href="#A3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a> with <math id="A3.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau=T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau=T</annotation></semantics></math> and using
<a href="#A3.E31" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">31</span></a> gives</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx66" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\operatorname{Reg}_{T}(u)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Reg</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\operatorname{Reg}_{T}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E32.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\eta_{T}D^{2}}{2}+\frac{n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{T}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}T}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+\frac{\sigma_{\tau}n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{\tau}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}\tau}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+G^{2}\sum_{t=\tau+1}^{T}\frac{|m_{t}|}{\eta_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\eta_{T}D^{2}}{2}+\frac{n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{T}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}T}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+\frac{\sigma_{\tau}n}{2\beta}\log\left(\frac{\eta_{\tau}}{\eta_{0}}+\frac{\beta G^{2}\tau}{n\eta_{0}}\right)+G^{2}\sum_{t=\tau+1}^{T}\frac{|m_{t}|}{\eta_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\eta_{0}D^{2}}{2}+\frac{n}{2\beta}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right)+\frac{3}{2}\frac{\sigma_{\max}n}{2\beta}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\eta_{0}D^{2}}{2}+\frac{n}{2\beta}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right)+\frac{3}{2}\frac{\sigma_{\max}n}{2\beta}\log\left(1+T+\frac{\beta GDT}{n}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
