<div id="A3.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A3.p17" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p17.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p17.1.1" class="ltx_text">For brevity, let
<math id="A3.p17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{t}\coloneq a_{t,t+d_{t}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≔</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{t}\coloneq a_{t,t+d_{t}}.</annotation></semantics></math>
The sequence
<math id="A3.p17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\eta_{t})_{t\geq 0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\eta_{t})_{t\geq 0}</annotation></semantics></math> is non-decreasing, the additional regularizer in
<math id="A3.p17.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is centered at <math id="A3.p17.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, and we also have
<math id="A3.p17.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}\in\arg\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}\overline{H}_{t}(x)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>min</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}\in\arg\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}\overline{H}_{t}(x).</annotation></semantics></math>
Hence, since <math id="A3.p17.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is quadratic, using the first-order optimality
of <math id="A3.p17.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> we have that for every <math id="A3.p17.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex129" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex129.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{H}_{t}(x)-\overline{H}_{t}(x_{t})\geq\frac{1}{2}(x-x_{t})^{\top}\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t}(x-x_{t})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{H}_{t}(x)-\overline{H}_{t}(x_{t})\geq\frac{1}{2}(x-x_{t})^{\top}\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t}(x-x_{t}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p17.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p17.2.1" class="ltx_text">Moreover,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex130" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex130.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{t}(x)-\ell_{t}(x_{t})=\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{t}(x)-\ell_{t}(x_{t})=\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p17.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p17.3.1" class="ltx_text">Also, by construction,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex131" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
