<p id="A3.p17.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p17.5.1" class="ltx_text">where the inequality uses
<math id="A3.p17.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{H}_{t}(x)-\overline{H}_{t}(x_{t})\geq\frac{1}{2}(x-x_{t})^{\top}\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t}(x-x_{t})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{H}_{t}(x)-\overline{H}_{t}(x_{t})\geq\frac{1}{2}(x-x_{t})^{\top}\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t}(x-x_{t}),</annotation></semantics></math>
together with
<math id="A3.p17.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{t}(x)-\ell_{t}(x_{t})=\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{t}(x)-\ell_{t}(x_{t})=\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle+\frac{\beta}{2}\langle g_{t},x-x_{t}\rangle^{2},</annotation></semantics></math>
and takes the minimum over a larger set, <math id="A3.p17.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{R}^{n}\supset\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⊃</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{R}^{n}\supset\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math>.
The last equality follows from unconstrained quadratic minimization,
whose minimizer is
<math id="A3.p17.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=x_{t}-\left(a_{t}\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t}+\beta g_{t}g_{t}^{\top}\right)^{-1}g_{t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=x_{t}-\left(a_{t}\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t}+\beta g_{t}g_{t}^{\top}\right)^{-1}g_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p>
