<p id="A3.p18.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p18.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the Sherman-Morrison formula,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex135" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
