<div id="Thmlemma7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the same assumptions as <a href="#A3.Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem C.1. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>,
