<math id="Thmlemma7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u\in\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u\in\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
