<div id="A3.5" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A3.p20" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p20.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p20.1.1" class="ltx_text">For any objective <math id="A3.p20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q:\mathcal{X}\to\mathbb{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>ℝ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q:\mathcal{X}\to\mathbb{R}</annotation></semantics></math>, define for brevity
<math id="A3.p20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{u}(Q)\coloneq Q(u)-\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}Q(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{u}(Q)\coloneq Q(u)-\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}Q(x)</annotation></semantics></math>.
For <math id="A3.p20.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\leq t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\leq t</annotation></semantics></math>, also define the regularized historical objective
<math id="A3.p20.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\tau,t}(x)\coloneq H_{\tau}(x)+\frac{\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1}}{2}\|x-x_{\tau}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\tau,t}(x)\coloneq H_{\tau}(x)+\frac{\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1}}{2}\|x-x_{\tau}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.
In particular, <math id="A3.p20.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{t,t}=H_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{t,t}=H_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Moreover, if
<math id="A3.p20.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A3.p20.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\tau+d_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\tau+d_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math>. Recalling the definition
of <math id="A3.p20.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{H}_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>τ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{H}_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math> in <a href="#A3.E25" title="In Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a>, we therefore
have <math id="A3.p20.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\tau,t+1}=\overline{H}_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\tau,t+1}=\overline{H}_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p21" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p21.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p21.1.1" class="ltx_text">We use the elementary properties
<math id="A3.p21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{u}(cQ)=c\,\Gamma_{u}(Q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{u}(cQ)=c\,\Gamma_{u}(Q)</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A3.p21.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, and
<math id="A3.p21.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{u}(Q_{1}+Q_{2})\leq\Gamma_{u}(Q_{1})+\Gamma_{u}(Q_{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{u}(Q_{1}+Q_{2})\leq\Gamma_{u}(Q_{1})+\Gamma_{u}(Q_{2})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Define the potential</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex137" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex137.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{t}\coloneq\Gamma_{u}(F_{t})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t-1}\Gamma_{u}(H_{\tau,t})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{t}\coloneq\Gamma_{u}(F_{t})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t-1}\Gamma_{u}(H_{\tau,t}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p22" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p22.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p22.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the definition of <math id="A3.p22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A3.p22.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}H_{t}=F_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}H_{\tau,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}H_{t}=F_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}H_{\tau,t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Therefore, using
<math id="A3.p22.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{\tau,t}+a_{\tau,t}=a_{\tau,t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{\tau,t}+a_{\tau,t}=a_{\tau,t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex138" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex138.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{t})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{\tau,t})\leq\Phi_{t}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{t})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{\tau,t})\leq\Phi_{t}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p23" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p23.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p23.1.1" class="ltx_text">We next increase the regularization level from <math id="A3.p23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math> to
<math id="A3.p23.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. Since <math id="A3.p23.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\eta_{t})_{t\geq 0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\eta_{t})_{t\geq 0}</annotation></semantics></math> is non-decreasing and <math id="A3.p23.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math> has diameter <math id="A3.p23.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math>, then
for every <math id="A3.p23.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z\in\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z\in\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex139" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex139.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1}}{2}\|u-z\|_{2}^{2}-\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}\frac{\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1}}{2}\|x-z\|_{2}^{2}\leq\frac{(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})D^{2}}{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>min</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1}}{2}\|u-z\|_{2}^{2}-\min_{x\in\mathcal{X}}\frac{\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1}}{2}\|x-z\|_{2}^{2}\leq\frac{(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})D^{2}}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p23.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p23.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="A3.p23.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}=1</annotation></semantics></math> (<a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>), it follows that</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex140" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex140.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{t,t+1})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{\tau,t+1})\leq\Phi_{t}+\frac{(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})D^{2}}{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{t,t+1})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\Gamma_{u}(H_{\tau,t+1})\leq\Phi_{t}+\frac{(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})D^{2}}{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p24" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p24.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p24.1.1" class="ltx_text">Using the disjoint partition
<math id="A3.p24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{t}\cup\{t\}=m_{t+1}\,\cup\,\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.392em">∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{t}\cup\{t\}=m_{t+1}\,\cup\,\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> (see <a href="#Thmlemma13" title="Lemma 13. ‣ Appendix D Supporting Lemmas ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>)
and <math id="A3.p24.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\tau,t+1}=\overline{H}_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\tau,t+1}=\overline{H}_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math> for
<math id="A3.p24.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, the left-hand side becomes</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex141" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
