<p id="A3.p24.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p24.2.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand, the update of <math id="A3.p24.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> is
<math id="A3.p24.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{t+1}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})H_{t,t+1}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}U_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{t+1}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})H_{t,t+1}+\sum_{\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{\tau,t}U_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Hence, by subadditivity of <math id="A3.p24.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma_{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma_{u}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
