<div id="A3.p33" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p33.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p33.1.1" class="ltx_text">Combining
<a href="#A3.E42" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equations</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">42</span></a>, <a href="#A3.E43" title="Equation 43 ‣ Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">43</span></a> and <a href="#A3.E48" title="Equation 48 ‣ Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">48</span></a>
