<div id="A3.p34" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p34.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p34.1.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, for every <math id="A3.p34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\in[T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\in[T]</annotation></semantics></math>, the arithmetic–geometric mean
inequality for the eigenvalues and <math id="A3.p34.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lVert g_{t}\rVert_{2}\leq G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lVert g_{t}\rVert_{2}\leq G</annotation></semantics></math> imply</span></p>
<table id="A3.E50" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
