<div id="A3.7" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A3.p35" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p35.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p35.1.1" class="ltx_text">The proof uses a potential function
argument similar to <a href="#Thmlemma4" title="Lemma 4. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, with scalar log-weights replaced by log-determinants of Hessians. Since <a href="#algorithm2" title="In 4.1 Improved Regret Bound for Exp-concave Losses ‣ 4 Universal Regret with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> uses the same updates for <math id="A3.p35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{r,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{r,t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p35.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> as <a href="#algorithm1" title="In Algorithm design. ‣ 3 Second-order Expert Aggregation with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, the same induction as in <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> gives</span></p>
<table id="A3.E52" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t-1}=1\;." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t-1}=1\;.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(52)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p35.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p35.2.1" class="ltx_text">Analogously to the potential used in the proof of <a href="#Thmlemma4" title="Lemma 4. ‣ A.3 Auxiliary Results for Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Omitted Details from ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, define</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx82" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Phi_{t}\coloneq S_{t}\log\det\left(\dfrac{\nabla^{2}F_{t}}{S_{t}}\right)+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t-1}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{\tau}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1})I\right)\;," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Phi_{t}\coloneq S_{t}\log\det\left(\dfrac{\nabla^{2}F_{t}}{S_{t}}\right)+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t-1}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{\tau}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1})I\right)\;,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(53)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p35.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p35.3.1" class="ltx_text">with the convention that <math id="A3.p35.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}\log\det\left(\dfrac{\nabla^{2}F_{t}}{S_{t}}\right)=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}\log\det\left(\dfrac{\nabla^{2}F_{t}}{S_{t}}\right)=0</annotation></semantics></math> whenever <math id="A3.p35.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t}=0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p36" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p36.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p36.1.1" class="ltx_text">In particular,
<math id="A3.p36.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Phi_{1}=\log\det(\eta_{0}I)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{1}=\log\det(\eta_{0}I).</annotation></semantics></math> We next compare <math id="A3.p36.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p36.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math>.
By the definition of <math id="A3.p36.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex160" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex160.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}\nabla^{2}H_{t}=\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{\tau}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1})I\right)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}\nabla^{2}H_{t}=\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{\tau}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1})I\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p36.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p36.2.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A3.p36.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}=S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}=S_{t}+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}\delta_{\tau,t}.</annotation></semantics></math>
Hence, by concavity of <math id="A3.p36.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\log\det" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">det</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log\det</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p37" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A3.EGx83" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex161"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex161.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Phi_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Phi_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex161.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq C_{t}\log\det(\nabla^{2}H_{t})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{\tau}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1})I\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq C_{t}\log\det(\nabla^{2}H_{t})+\sum_{\tau\in m_{t}}a_{\tau,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{\tau}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{\tau-1})I\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex162"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex162.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{t}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{t}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
