<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E54.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\log\det(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r})\;." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\log\det(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r})\;.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(54)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p37.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p37.1.1" class="ltx_text">For the second inequality, since <math id="A3.p37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\eta_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\eta_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> is non-decreasing and
<math id="A3.p37.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\log\det" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">det</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log\det</annotation></semantics></math> is monotone with respect to the positive-semidefinite order,
we may increase the regularization level from <math id="A3.p37.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math> to
<math id="A3.p37.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> in the first line. We then write
<math id="A3.p37.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+a_{t,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+a_{t,t}</annotation></semantics></math> and use
<math id="A3.p37.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{t}\cup\{t\}=m_{t+1}\,\cup\,\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.392em">∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{t}\cup\{t\}=m_{t+1}\,\cup\,\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>
(<a href="#Thmlemma13" title="Lemma 13. ‣ Appendix D Supporting Lemmas ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>)
to partition the remaining terms according to whether their feedback
is still missing at round <math id="A3.p37.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t+1</annotation></semantics></math> or is revealed at the end of round
<math id="A3.p37.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>. Finally, for every <math id="A3.p37.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A3.p37.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=r+d_{r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=r+d_{r}</annotation></semantics></math>, and
hence
<math id="A3.p37.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I=\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I=\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r},</annotation></semantics></math>
which gives the second inequality.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p38" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p38.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p38.1.1" class="ltx_text">For every <math id="A3.p38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau\in\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A3.p38.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=\tau+d_{\tau}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=\tau+d_{\tau}</annotation></semantics></math>, and
<math id="A3.p38.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}U_{\tau}=\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{\tau}+\frac{\beta}{a_{\tau,t}}g_{\tau}g_{\tau}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}U_{\tau}=\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{\tau}+\frac{\beta}{a_{\tau,t}}g_{\tau}g_{\tau}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math>
Thus, by the matrix determinant lemma,</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx84" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E55.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\log\det(\nabla^{2}U_{\tau})-\log\det(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{\tau})=\log\left(1+\frac{\beta}{a_{\tau,t}}\lVert g_{\tau}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{\tau})^{-1}}^{2}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><msubsup><mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>τ</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\log\det(\nabla^{2}U_{\tau})-\log\det(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{\tau})=\log\left(1+\frac{\beta}{a_{\tau,t}}\lVert g_{\tau}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{\tau})^{-1}}^{2}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(55)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p38.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p38.2.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand, by definition,</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx85" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Phi_{t+1}=S_{t+1}\log\det\left(\dfrac{\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}}{S_{t+1}}\right)+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Phi_{t+1}=S_{t+1}\log\det\left(\dfrac{\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}}{S_{t+1}}\right)+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(56)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p38.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p38.3.1" class="ltx_text">Moreover, the update of <math id="A3.p38.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> gives</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex163" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex163.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\left(\nabla^{2}H_{t}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I\right)+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\nabla^{2}U_{r}\;," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\left(\nabla^{2}H_{t}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I\right)+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\nabla^{2}U_{r}\;,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p38.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p38.4.1" class="ltx_text">while
<math id="A3.p38.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{t+1}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{t+1}=(C_{t}-a_{t,t})+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Hence, by concavity of <math id="A3.p38.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\log\det" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">det</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log\det</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx86" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex164"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex164.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Phi_{t+1}\geq{}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Phi_{t+1}\geq{}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex164.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{t}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(C_{t}-a_{t,t})\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{t}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E57"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E57.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\log\det(\nabla^{2}U_{r})+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\log\det(\nabla^{2}U_{r})+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\log\det\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(57)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p39" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p39.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p39.1.1" class="ltx_text">Combining the upper bound on <math id="A3.p39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> in
<a href="#A3.E54" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">54</span></a> with the lower bound on
<math id="A3.p39.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> in <a href="#A3.E57" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">57</span></a>, and using
<a href="#A3.E55" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">55</span></a>, yields</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex165" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex165.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{t+1}-\Phi_{t}\geq\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\log\left(1+\frac{\beta}{a_{r,t}}\lVert g_{r}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r})^{-1}}^{2}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">≥</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{t+1}-\Phi_{t}\geq\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}a_{r,t}\log\left(1+\frac{\beta}{a_{r,t}}\lVert g_{r}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r})^{-1}}^{2}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p40" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p40.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p40.1.1" class="ltx_text">Summing above inequality over
<math id="A3.p40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1,\ldots,T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1,\ldots,T</annotation></semantics></math> yields</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx87" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E58"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{t=1}^{T}a_{t,t+d_{t}}\log\left(1+\frac{\beta}{a_{t,t+d_{t}}}\lVert g_{t}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t})^{-1}}^{2}\right)\leq\Phi_{T+1}-\Phi_{1}\;." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{t=1}^{T}a_{t,t+d_{t}}\log\left(1+\frac{\beta}{a_{t,t+d_{t}}}\lVert g_{t}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{t})^{-1}}^{2}\right)\leq\Phi_{T+1}-\Phi_{1}\;.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(58)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p41" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p41.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p41.1.1" class="ltx_text">It remains to identify <math id="A3.p41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{T+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{T+1}</annotation></semantics></math>. Tracking the weighted Hessian
through the updates of <a href="#algorithm2" title="In 4.1 Improved Regret Bound for Exp-concave Losses ‣ 4 Universal Regret with Delayed Feedback ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and using
<a href="#A3.E52" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">52</span></a> shows by induction that</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx88" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E59.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{r\in m_{t}}a_{r,t-1}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)=\eta_{t-1}I+\beta\sum_{r\in o_{t}}g_{r}g_{r}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{r\in m_{t}}a_{r,t-1}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)=\eta_{t-1}I+\beta\sum_{r\in o_{t}}g_{r}g_{r}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(59)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p41.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p41.2.1" class="ltx_text">To verify <a href="#A3.E59" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">59</span></a>, the case <math id="A3.p41.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1</annotation></semantics></math> follows from
<math id="A3.p41.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}F_{1}=\eta_{0}I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}F_{1}=\eta_{0}I</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p41.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o_{1}=m_{1}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o_{1}=m_{1}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>.
Suppose the identity holds at round <math id="A3.p41.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>. Substituting the update of
<math id="A3.p41.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math>, using
<math id="A3.p41.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{t}\nabla^{2}H_{t}=\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{r\in m_{t}}\delta_{r,t}(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{r-1})I)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{t}\nabla^{2}H_{t}=\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{r\in m_{t}}\delta_{r,t}(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{r-1})I)</annotation></semantics></math>,
together with
<math id="A3.p41.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{r,t}+a_{r,t}=a_{r,t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{r,t}+a_{r,t}=a_{r,t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A3.p41.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{t}\cup\{t\}=m_{t+1}\cup\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{t}\cup\{t\}=m_{t+1}\cup\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, and
<a href="#A3.E52" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">52</span></a>, gives</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex166" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex166X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex166X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex166Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex166Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{r\in m_{t}}a_{r,t-1}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I+\beta\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}g_{r}g_{r}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="2.278em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\nabla^{2}F_{t}+\sum_{r\in m_{t}}a_{r,t-1}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t-1}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{t-1})I+\beta\sum_{r\in\mathcal{F}_{t}}g_{r}g_{r}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p41.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p41.3.1" class="ltx_text">The induction hypothesis and
<math id="A3.p41.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o_{t+1}=o_{t}\cup\mathcal{F}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o_{t+1}=o_{t}\cup\mathcal{F}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> therefore yield</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex167" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex167.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)=\eta_{t}I+\beta\sum_{r\in o_{t+1}}g_{r}g_{r}^{\top}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}F_{t+1}+\sum_{r\in m_{t+1}}a_{r,t}\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{t}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)=\eta_{t}I+\beta\sum_{r\in o_{t+1}}g_{r}g_{r}^{\top},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p41.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p41.4.1" class="ltx_text">which proves <a href="#A3.E59" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">59</span></a> by induction.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p42" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p42.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p42.1.1" class="ltx_text">Since all feedback has been revealed by the end of round <math id="A3.p42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A3.p42.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{T+1}=\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{T+1}=\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence
<a href="#A3.E52" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">52</span></a> and
<a href="#A3.E59" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">59</span></a> imply
<math id="A3.p42.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{T+1}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{T+1}=1</annotation></semantics></math>
and <math id="A3.p42.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}F_{T+1}=\eta_{T}I+\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}g_{t}g_{t}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}F_{T+1}=\eta_{T}I+\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}g_{t}g_{t}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math>
Therefore,</span></p>
<table id="A3.Ex168" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex168.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Phi_{T+1}=\log\det\left(\eta_{T}I+\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}g_{t}g_{t}^{\top}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{T+1}=\log\det\left(\eta_{T}I+\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}g_{t}g_{t}^{\top}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p42.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p42.2.1" class="ltx_text">and <a href="#A3.E58" title="In Proof. ‣ Appendix C Omitted Details from Section ‣ Universal Online Convex Optimization With Delayed Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">58</span></a>, together with
<math id="A3.p42.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Phi_{1}=\log\det(\eta_{0}I)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">det</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{1}=\log\det(\eta_{0}I)</annotation></semantics></math>, gives</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx89" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

