<div id="A3.p45" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p45.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p45.1.1" class="ltx_text">For every <math id="A3.p45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in m_{\tau+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in m_{\tau+1}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A3.p45.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r+d_{r}&gt;\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r+d_{r}&gt;\tau</annotation></semantics></math>.
Since <math id="A3.p45.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{r,s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{r,s}</annotation></semantics></math> is non-increasing in <math id="A3.p45.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A3.p45.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{r,r+d_{r}}\leq a_{r,\tau}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{r,r+d_{r}}\leq a_{r,\tau}.</annotation></semantics></math> Moreover, since <math id="A3.p45.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\eta_{s})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\eta_{s})</annotation></semantics></math> is non-decreasing,
<math id="A3.p45.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r}=\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{r+d_{r}}-\eta_{r-1})I\succeq\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{\tau}-\eta_{r-1})I," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>⪰</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r}=\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{r+d_{r}}-\eta_{r-1})I\succeq\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{\tau}-\eta_{r-1})I,</annotation></semantics></math> so
<math id="A3.p45.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lVert g_{r}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r})^{-1}}^{2}\leq\left\lVert g_{r}\right\rVert_{\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{\tau}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)^{-1}}^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lVert g_{r}\rVert_{(\nabla^{2}\overline{H}_{r})^{-1}}^{2}\leq\left\lVert g_{r}\right\rVert_{\left(\nabla^{2}H_{r}+(\eta_{\tau}-\eta_{r-1})I\right)^{-1}}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math> Finally, the function</span></p>
